OL,3,GNEWSAGreen shoots springing up in park
OL,4,Ahit by fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FNature is beginning to return to a
OL,7,Fcountry park two months after a
OL,8,Fdevastating wildfire, bosses have said.
OL,10,FThe fire ripped through more than 50
OL,11,Facres of Mincinglake Valley Park on the
OL,12,Fedge of Exeter on 11 August, prompting
OL,13,Fthe call-out of 20 fire crews.
OL,15,FDevon Wildlife Trust, which manages the
OL,16,Fsite on behalf of Exeter City Council,
OL,17,Fsaid green bramble bushes, wildflowers
OL,18,Fand various small birds and mammals
OL,19,Fwere re-establishing in the charred
OL,20,Flandscape.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
